  · exact absurd (h2.1.symm.trans h1.1.symm) h1.2.2.2
  · exact absurd (h2.1.symm.trans h1.1.symm) h1.2.2.2
  · exact absurd h3.1 h1.2.2.2
  · rw [if_pos h1, if_neg h2, if_neg h3, if_pos (show twoeqC A1 A2 A3 from Or.inl h1)]
